msgid "Deleting a version"
msgstr "Excluir uma versão"

#: includes/class-bdwp70-plugin.php:4033
msgid "removes its record, books, and verses, and cannot be undone. URLs of the deleted version redirect to the same passage in the active Bible. To replace a translation, import the new one, activate it, and then delete the old one."
